# Read only server-side, by `skills/buildRequest.ts` (AD-11, the sole
# `@anthropic-ai/sdk` assembly point) via `process.env` — never exposed to
# the client. Copy this file to `.env.local` (already gitignored) and set
# a real key to enable sending messages from the workspace composer.
#
# The scripted demo mode (spec-mode-demo-scripte.md) no longer needs a
# `DEMO_MODE` variable here: spec-toggle-mode-demo-ui.md moved its
# activation to a toggle button in the app itself (persisted on
# `APP_STATE.demoModeActive`, `actions/demo.ts`) — no `.env.local` edit or
# server restart needed to demo without this key set.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
